15.390">So </span><span begin="00:15.390" end="00:15.630">this </span><span begin="00:15.630" end="00:16.890">life </span><span begin="00:16.890" end="00:17.250">is </span><span begin="00:17.250" end="00:17.640">always </span><span begin="00:17.640" end="00:17.850">with </span><span begin="00:17.850" end="00:19.470">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.500" end="00:22.980"><span begin="00:19.500" end="00:19.710">The </span><span begin="00:19.710" end="00:19.950">ice </span><span begin="00:19.950" end="00:20.310">inside </span><span begin="00:20.310" end="00:20.520">my </span><span begin="00:20.520" end="00:20.850">veins </span><span begin="00:20.850" end="00:21.030">will </span><span begin="00:21.030" end="00:21.690">never </span><span begin="00:21.690" end="00:22.980">bleed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.960" end="00:34.800"><span begin="00:30.960" end="00:31.320">Every </span><span begin="00:31.320" end="00:32.850">time </span><span begin="00:32.850" end="00:32.970">you </span><span begin="00:32.970" end="00:33.150">try </span><span begin="00:33.150" end="00:33.270">to </span><span begin="00:33.270" end="00:33.600">fix </span><span begin="00:33.600" end="00:34.800">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.250" end="00:38.520"><span begin="00:35.250" end="00:35.430">I </span><span begin="00:35.430" end="00:35.580">know </span><span begin="00:35.580" end="00:35.790">you'll </span><span begin="00:35.790" end="00:36.210">never </span><span begin="00:36.210" end="00:36.540">find </span><span begin="00:36.540" end="00:36.810">that </span><span begin="00:36.810" end="00:37.260">missing </span><span begin="00:37.260" end="00:38.520">piece</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.760" end="00:42.870"><span begin="00:38.760" end="00:39.000">When </span><span begin="00:39.000" end="00:39.150">you </span><span begin="00:39.150" end="00:40.740">cry </span><span begin="00:40.740" end="00:40.860">and </span><span begin="00:40.860" end="00:41.040">say </span><